<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-29T02:40:01.832Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:40:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Rapid Support Forces carried out a drone strike on Nyala, killing at least 21 people and injuring 40 while cutting power in southeast Sudan. In the Blue Nile, the Sudanese Armed Forces repelled a fresh RSF and SPLM-N assault, seizing 15 combat vehicles. Saudi Arabia reported that its air defenses intercepted Houthi missiles over the capital, and the West warned of a famine risk as the war grinds on. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPWkJTOVR2MzAyWEJiZG9IUzdraU9WU3VoVG1NUVlLdFFLblR2Q21HTEdPZGJvSFdCZk1vZllNOEk5Tmd2ZlNEMDlGbEdQU3pZa2wxVEJ4Rk9DRnowYkE4UENuZ2tPbHJjalZEZXhKQ3pmOGhxUWdGbzdpMWppXzJvaGx5TkIyQTAtWFZZb3cxNVh2UWNmLVRJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA4Ml8zTWxDb3BONnN4dVZfZEkzWkx3cGpLMEpSRXZ5V3ZQSmFHYk8tazNKNjJIRFVRZl8xRGNmZG95NmVZTXMwRTJ5NWhyWExDVlBBLXBWbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOeklWd1RmSzlrVkcyZjljUW9FUEx4aDFKM0tEX25VaU1PSE5JTlBiUGpLMDVGcnZIa2JpekhwZHB3cjZnU0JZMTBSTVJxcTkxWHpqY3ZkYXJDOWdFNndnU1pkQmVGQlYzRkpMTDRZOHNPYTdxQnF1eTFoczBMXzFEN1lYVy03QU9QaFprZjREc0JBV0FycWI2ZWdBUFBoajloZm1ydDB5RmxLdEFpVlBMUldlUzY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUk43d1lISlFiS2U5LXNjN3BVRWtfVGI1ZTIwMTNmYUJyN2pNQzQyNDk0NTZsSTBpQnAxNnlVc0ZReVVtT1IyMG1aaDJoeTVOOHJUekZwQy1Bcm1PdXE2akEwbnFyZHFveE5aVGxIbEsteXZpWDdfX1ZucHdZejdSejloWGYxb1FtWEVEVW1jZWt6VHJOS3A2OE9SVmYzQkV6a1daUTc3V0dhTmpfS1VDbGxvSFU3N2xDTFpJS3BZcVdzUmZfclE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https:/